How to create this in Figma
===========================
Use Figma FigJam to create the mind map:
========================================
Create a new FigJam board.
Put "Desktop App Design" in the center.
Create branches:
User Research
Information Architecture
Wireframing
Visual Design
Prototype
Usability Testing
Developer Handoff
Add the subtopics under each branch.
Use colors and icons to distinguish different stages.

                 [Desktop App Design]
                          │
 ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐
 │          │          │          │
Research   IA      Wireframe   Visual Design
 │          │          │          │
Persona  Sitemap   Menu Bar    Colors
Goals    Navigation Sidebar    Typography
Needs    Structure  Content    Icons
                          │
                     Prototype
                          │
               Navigation • Animation
                          │
                     Testing
                          │
                   Feedback • Fixes
                          │
                  Developer Handoff
                          │
                 Assets • Components

This mind map works well for desktop applications such as calculators, inventory systems, ERP 
systems, POS systems, and productivity tools.  
